    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there are people, but it doesn't change the reality. no matter who i talk to, tomorrow is just gonna be the same as today. the same chores, the same demands, the same feeling of being totally hollow. it feels like i'm just stuck in this loop that never ends. i feel like if i just stopped everything... if i just gave up... maybe the noise would finally go away. is that wrong to even think about?",
